stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Initializing: Connect
    Initializing --> ReadyForTraffic: Capabilities
    ReadyForTraffic --> Active: Control traffic
    Active --> Closing: CloseConnection
    Closing --> Completed: Close reply
    Completed --> ClosedOrAborted: Transport close

    Idle --> ClosedOrAborted: Setup failure
    Initializing --> ClosedOrAborted: Setup failure
    ReadyForTraffic --> ClosedOrAborted: Session abort
    Active --> ClosedOrAborted: Transport abort

    ClosedOrAborted --> [*]
